    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "If you are facing connectivity issues, getting “Trying to Connect“ on my device screen.\n",
      "image": null,
      "bold": true
    },

    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. Force Stop the NoiseFit app. \n\nGo to settings > Apps & notifications > App info > NoiseFit app > Force Stop.\n",
      "image": null,
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. Turn ‘off’ and then ‘on’ your smartphone’s Bluetooth.\n",
      "image": null,
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. Make sure to give location permission to NoiseFit app. \n\nNote: You’ll have to provide location access manually if not provided earlier.\n",
      "image": null,
      "bold": false
    },
